      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.12.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD came down in the pillar of the cloud, and stood ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the door of the tabernacle, and called Aaron and Miriam: and they both came forth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.12.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.12.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said, Hear now my words: If there is a prophet among you, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "I",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD will make myself known to him in a vision, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " will speak to him in a dream.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.12.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.12.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My servant Moses ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not so, who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " faithful in all my house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.12.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.12.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "With him will I speak mouth to mouth, even apparently, and not in dark speeches; and the similitude of the LORD shall he behold: why then were ye not afraid to speak against my servant Moses?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.12.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.12.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the anger of the LORD was kindled against them; and he departed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.12.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.12.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
